              "hidden": ""
            },
            "Categories": {
              "value": "Phallus impudicus|Lysurus (fungus)|Clathrus|Aseroe rubra|Lysurus periphragmoides|Clathrus crispus|Kunstformen der Natur|PD Old|Unidentified Geastrum|CC-PD-Mark|Coprinus comatus - botanical illustrations|PD-old missing SDC copyright status|Clathrus ruber illustrations|Unidentified Phallus (fungus)",
              "source": "commons-categories",
              "hidden": ""
            },
            "Assessments": {
              "value": "",
              "source": "commons-categories",
              "hidden": ""
            },
            "ImageDescription": {
              "value": "<p>See <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://caliban.mpiz-koeln.mpg.de/haeckel/kunstformen/high/Tafel_063_300.html\">here</a><sup class=\"noprint Inline-Template\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">[<span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span title=\"\" class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Link_rot\">dead link</a></span></span>]</span></sup> for index to numbers.\n</p>\n<ol><li><i>Dictyophora madonna</i> <small>(Haeckel)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Phallus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Phallus\">Phallus</a></i> sp.?, mature fruiting body</li>\n<li><i>Phallus impudicus</i> <small>(Linné)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Phallus_impudicus\" title=\"Phallus impudicus\">Phallus impudicus</a></i> <small>L.</small>, mature fruiting body with lengthwise section of volva</li>\n<li><i>Aseroë rubra</i> <small>(Billardière)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Aseroe_rubra\" title=\"Category:Aseroe rubra\">Aseroë rubra</a></i> <small>Labill.</small>, mature fruiting body</li>\n<li><i>Clathrus cancellatus</i> <small>(Tournefort)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Clathrus_ruber\" title=\"Clathrus ruber\">Clathrus ruber</a></i> <small>P.Micheli ex Pers.</small>, mature fruiting body</li>\n<li><i>Clathrella crispa</i> <small>(E. Fischer)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Clathrus_crispus&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Clathrus crispus (page does not exist)\">Clathrus crispus</a></i> <small>Turpin</small>, mature fruiting body</li>\n<li><i>Clathrella pusilla</i> <small>(E. Fischer)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Clathrus_pusillus&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Clathrus pusillus (page does not exist)\">Clathrus pusillus</a></i> <small>Berk.</small>, mature fruiting body</li>\n<li><i>Calathiscus sepia</i> <small>(Montague)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Lysurus&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Lysurus (page does not exist)\">Lysurus</a></i> sp.?, mature fruiting body</li>\n<li><i>Simblum sphaerocephalum</i> <small>(Klotsch)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Lysurus_periphragmoides\" title=\"Category:Lysurus periphragmoides\">Category:Lysurus periphragmoides</a></i> <small>(Klotzsch) Dring</small>, mature fruiting body</li>\n<li><i>Anthurus borealis</i> <small>(Burton)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Lysurus_borealis&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Lysurus borealis (page does not exist)\">Lysurus borealis</a></i> <small>(Burt) Henn.</small>, young fruiting body in cross-section</li>\n<li><i>Geaster multifidus</i> <small>(Micheli) (<i>non</i> Pers.: <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Geastrum_multifidum&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Geastrum multifidum (page does not exist)\">preoccupied</a>)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Geastrum\" title=\"Geastrum\">Geastrum</a></i> sp., mature fruiting body</li>\n<li><i>Coprinus comatus</i> <small>(Müller)</small> = <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Coprinus_comatus\" title=\"Coprinus comatus\">Coprinus comatus</a></i> <small>(O.F.Müll.) Pers.</small>, mature fruiting body</li></ol>",
              "source": "commons-desc-page"
            },
            "DateTimeOriginal": {
              "value": "1904",
              "source": "commons-desc-page"
            },
            "Credit": {
              "value": "<i>Kunstformen der Natur</i> (1904), plate 63: Basimycetes (see <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://caliban.mpiz-koeln.mpg.de/haeckel/kunstformen/high/Tafel_063_300.html\">here</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://caliban.mpiz-koeln.mpg.de/haeckel/kunstformen/high/Tafel_063_schema_300.html\">here</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://caliban.mpiz-koeln.mpg.de/haeckel/kunstformen/high/Tafel_063_text_1_200.html\">here</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://caliban.mpiz-koeln.mpg.de/haeckel/kunstformen/high/Tafel_063_text_2_200.html\">here</a>)",
              "source": "commons-desc-page"
            },
            "Artist": {
              "value": "<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Ernst_Haeckel\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Ernst Haeckel\"><span title=\"German zoologist (1834-1919)\">Ernst Haeckel</span></a></bdi>",
